Dave Krieger writes:
> At 10:38 AM 12/1/94, Plaz wrote:
> >At 11:19 AM 12/1/94 -0500, Phil Goetz wrote:
> >>It's my impression that the vast majority of economists would agree with
> >>the first poster:  printing money causes inflation.
> >
